summary:
  Coming home from a cast leaves the order dated by when the cast began.

history:
  The heartbeat stands still during a cast, so after a long one the first
  local hiccup found the order lapsed and stopped the radio.

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
          // the whole cast long: dated here, or its first local hiccup ends it.
          _orderDated();

replace:
          // the whole cast long: dated here, or its first local hiccup ends it.
          void 0;

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_every_automatic_road_to_sound_asks_whether_the_order_lapsed.
  Line-neutral.
